  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Posilnenie bezpe&#x10d;nosti juhov&#xfd;chodnej Eur&#xf3;py: cesta k &#xfa;spe&#x161;nej integr&#xe1;cii</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Security of the South-East Europe: Towards Successfull Integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Hlavn&#xfd;m cie&#x13e;om projektu bolo zv&#xfd;&#x161;i&#x165; podporu integr&#xe1;cie do euroatlantick&#xfd;ch &#x161;trukt&#xfa;r informovan&#xed;m &#x161;irokej verejnosti o benefitoch &#x10d;lenstva v Sveroatlantickej aliancii a E&#xda;, a to odovzd&#xe1;van&#xed;m sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; SR s implement&#xe1;ciou integra&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch reforiem.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the project was to increase support for integration into Euro-Atlantic structures and the EU through with sharing experience&#xa0;from the&#xa0;integration reforms and&#xa0;raising awareness activities about the benefits of NATO and the EU membership targeted at&#xa0;the general public,&#xa0;media and opinion-makers.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
